{"id":"0ce709e0d2857990","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-first-order-structure.md","title":"First-Order Structure","display":"df-first-order-structure — First-Order Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-first-order-structure","aliases":["93-df-first-order-structure"],"display":"df-first-order-structure — First-Order Structure","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-language]]","[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-first-order-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-first-order-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-structure — First-Order Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}\\)</span> are the sourced symbol and arity projections of the same <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}\\)</span> is the sublanguage predicate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}\\)</span> is the sourced bijection predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle\\)</span> has a nonempty carrier, total interpretations for functions, and relation interpretations of the matching arities.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOFunInt}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FOFunInt}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FORelInt}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FORelInt}_{93}\\)</span> are the interpretation-family projections defined here; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSubstruct}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSubstruct}_{93}\\)</span>, reduct, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOIso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOIso}_{93}\\)</span> are also defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\exists A,I_F,I_R\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land I_F:\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to V\n\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n(I_F(f):A^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\\to A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land I_R:\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to V\n\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n(I_R(r)\\subseteq A^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\exists A,I_F,I_R\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land I_F:\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to V\n\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n(I_F(f):A^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\\to A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land I_R:\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to V\n\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n(I_R(r)\\subseteq A^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n|\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle|&amp;\\coloneqq A,&amp;\n\\operatorname{FOFunInt}_{93}(\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq I_F,&amp;\n\\operatorname{FORelInt}_{93}(\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq I_R,\\\\\nf^{\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FOFunInt}_{93}(\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle)(f),&amp;\nr^{\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FORelInt}_{93}(\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle)(r).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n|\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle|&amp;\\coloneqq A,&amp;\n\\operatorname{FOFunInt}_{93}(\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq I_F,&amp;\n\\operatorname{FORelInt}_{93}(\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq I_R,\\\\\nf^{\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FOFunInt}_{93}(\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle)(f),&amp;\nr^{\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FORelInt}_{93}(\\langle A,I_F,I_R\\rangle)(r).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOSubstruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\n\\land|\\mathfrak A|\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\n\\;(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a)=f^{\\mathfrak B}(\\bar a))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\bigl(r^{\\mathfrak A}=r^{\\mathfrak B}\\cap|\\mathfrak A|^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOSubstruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\n\\land|\\mathfrak A|\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\n\\;(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a)=f^{\\mathfrak B}(\\bar a))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\bigl(r^{\\mathfrak A}=r^{\\mathfrak B}\\cap|\\mathfrak A|^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\langle|\\mathfrak A|,\n\\operatorname{FOFunInt}_{93}(\\mathfrak A)\\!\\upharpoonright\n\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0),\n\\operatorname{FORelInt}_{93}(\\mathfrak A)\\!\\upharpoonright\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\Bigr\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\n\\to\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\langle|\\mathfrak A|,\n\\operatorname{FOFunInt}_{93}(\\mathfrak A)\\!\\upharpoonright\n\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0),\n\\operatorname{FORelInt}_{93}(\\mathfrak A)\\!\\upharpoonright\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\Bigr\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\n\\to\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOIso}_{93}(h,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(h,|\\mathfrak A|,|\\mathfrak B|)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\\;\nh(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a))=f^{\\mathfrak B}(h\\circ\\bar a)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\;\n(\\bar a\\in r^{\\mathfrak A}\\leftrightarrow h\\circ\\bar a\\in r^{\\mathfrak B}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOIso}_{93}(h,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(h,|\\mathfrak A|,|\\mathfrak B|)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\\;\nh(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a))=f^{\\mathfrak B}(h\\circ\\bar a)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\;\n(\\bar a\\in r^{\\mathfrak A}\\leftrightarrow h\\circ\\bar a\\in r^{\\mathfrak B}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c79336c0ca9ddde8\" href=\"?note=c79336c0ca9ddde8\" title=\"93-df-structure\">93-df-structure</a> remains the operation-only algebraic notion. This atom adds genuine relation interpretations and explicit family projections; reducts are formed by graph restriction rather than prose-indexed component tuples.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","lev